        <mxCell id="notes1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes — constraints &amp;amp; conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;b&gt;time_slots grain:&lt;/b&gt; one row = one 30-minute grid cell (CHECK end_time = start_time + interval '30 minutes'); a meeting spans several consecutive rows.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Partial UNIQUE indexes&lt;/b&gt; (not drawn as column markers):&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; uq_replacement_requests_active_block (class_session_id, week_number) WHERE status IN ('pending','approved')&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; time_slots_no_double_book_idx (venue_id, day_of_week, start_time, week_number) WHERE status IN ('pending','occupied')&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;UK₁ = member of a composite unique key&lt;/b&gt; (one shared key over all marked columns).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK enums:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; users.role ∈ {student, lecturer} (no admin role; authority = lecturers.is_pl)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; time_slots.status ∈ {available, pending, occupied}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; venues.room_type ∈ {tutorial, lecture_hall, lab, cisco_lab}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; replacement_requests.status ∈ {pending, approved, rejected, cancelled, completed}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; class_exceptions.reason ∈ {public_holiday, annual_leave, medical_leave, official_event, emergency_leave}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; audit_logs.action ∈ {submitted, approved, rejected, cancelled, completed, occ_conflict, class_cancelled}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; class_sessions.session_type ∈ {L, T, P}&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; week_number ∈ 1–14; day_of_week ∈ 0–5 (Mon–Sat)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; cohorts.current_year 1–3, semester 1–3, student_count &amp;gt; 0&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; time_slots.start_time minute ∈ {00, 30}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="1860" y="770" width="345" height="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
